<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#071b33"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/>
<meta name="description" content="Chilton App Works blueprint-style website preview. Professional websites from $149 plus transparent separately disclosed domain, hosting and email costs."/>
<title>Chilton App Works | The Digital Workshop Preview</title>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
<div class="preview-ribbon"><span><i></i> CHILTON APP WORKS · DESIGN DIRECTION: THE DIGITAL WORKSHOP</span><a href="/chilton-app-works-preview">View original preview ↗</a></div>
<header>
  <a class="logo" href="#top" aria-label="Chilton App Works home"><img src={logo} width="295" height="116" alt="Official Chilton App Works blue and green logo" /></a>
  <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Site sections"><a href="#approach">What we do</a><a href="#evidence">Why a website</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="#care">Website care</a></nav>
  <a class="header-contact" href={mail('Project conversation')}>Start a project <span>↗</span></a>
  <details class="mobile-nav"><summary>Explore <span>☰</span></summary><nav aria-label="Mobile sections"><a href="#approach">What we do</a><a href="#evidence">Why a website</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="#care">Website care</a><a href="#contact">Get in touch</a></nav></details>
</header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero" id="top">
<div class="hero-grid">
  <div class="hero-lead">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="spark">✳</span> DIGITAL TOOLS FOR INDEPENDENT BUSINESSES</div>
    <h1>Small business.<br/><span>Big presence.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-description">Websites that look sharp. Custom apps that actually help. Clear pricing and no confusing handoffs. Created in Chilton, Wisconsin.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary" href="#pricing">See the website packages <b>↗</b></a><a class="underlink" href="#approach">See what we build ↗</a></div>
    <div class="hero-foot"><span>✓ No lock-in tricks</span><span>✓ Real ownership</span><span>✓ Scope before spending</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-display">
    <div class="gridboard"></div>
    <div class="scribble">THE PLAN</div>
    <div class="mock-browser">
      <div class="browser-bar"><span>● ● ●</span><span>yoursmallbusiness.com</span><span>↗</span></div>
      <div class="mock-body">
        <div class="mock-top"><b>YOUR BRAND<span>✳</span></b><small>SERVICES &nbsp; ABOUT &nbsp; CONTACT</small></div>
        <div class="mock-title">Make it<br/>happen<span>.</span></div>
        <div class="mock-cta">LET'S TALK ↗</div>
        <div class="mock-cards"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="price-ticket"><small>WEBSITES FROM</small><strong>$149</strong><span>ONE-TIME BUILD</span></div>
    <div class="display-bottom">DESIGNED TO GET YOU NOTICED. ENGINEERED TO WORK.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="hero-smallprint">The $149 starter covers a scoped one-page template website. Domain, hosting, paid email services and optional additions cost extra.</div>
</section>
<section class="intro-rail" aria-label="Our promises"><span>YOUR BUSINESS FIRST</span><b>✳</b><span>NO HIDDEN SURPRISES</span><b>✳</b><span>YOU OWN YOUR DOMAIN</span><b>✳</b><span>NO LONG-TERM CARE CONTRACT</span></section>
<section class="section" id="approach">
  <div class="section-head"><div><p class="section-kicker">BUILT FOR THE WAY YOU WORK</p><h2>Whatever's next,<br/>we can <em>build it.</em></h2></div><p>Not everything needs a complicated software platform. Sometimes you need a great website. Sometimes you need something made just for your business.</p></div>
  <div class="bento">
    <article class="bento-large"><span class="service-label">WEB PRESENCE</span><h3>A website people<br/>remember.</h3><p>Clean pages, fast mobile experiences, clear calls to action, and a professional home for your business.</p><a href="#pricing">Explore websites ↗</a><div class="bento-geometry" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></article>
    <article class="bento-app"><span class="service-label">CUSTOM SOFTWARE</span><h3>Apps built around you.</h3><p>Workflow tools, client portals, operational dashboards and small-business automations.</p><a href={mail('Custom application estimate')}>Get an app quote ↗</a><div class="app-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>TEAM WORKSPACE</span><div><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></article>
    <article class="bento-email"><span class="service-label">BUSINESS EMAIL</span><h3>Your domain.<br/>Your inbox.</h3><p>One-time setup starting at <b>$49</b>, with provider mailbox subscriptions separate.</p><a href={mail('Business email setup')}>Ask about email ↗</a></article>
    <article class="bento-care"><span class="service-label">ONGOING SUPPORT</span><h3>Help without the hassle.</h3><p>Optional, clearly scoped hosting and upkeep. Keep control of your site and your providers.</p><a href="#care">See monthly options ↗</a></article>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="evidence-section" id="evidence">
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-head evidence-head"><div><p class="section-kicker">WHY IT MATTERS</p><h2>Your customers<br/>are <em>online.</em></h2></div><p>A professional website helps people evaluate your business and find the next step. Visibility isn't a luxury when your customers start with a search.</p></div>
  <div class="fact-grid">
    <article><strong>84<span>%</span></strong><p>of surveyed U.S. consumers searched online for a local business in the prior three months.</p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.brightlocal.com/research/consumer-search-behavior-channels/">BRIGHTLOCAL · 2026 ↗</a></article>
    <article><strong>73<span>%</span></strong><p>of recent local-business searches surveyed began on a mobile device.</p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.brightlocal.com/research/consumer-search-behavior-channels/">BRIGHTLOCAL · 2026 ↗</a></article>
    <article><strong>20<span>%</span></strong><p>ranked a professional-looking website among their top three reasons to contact or visit a business.</p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.brightlocal.com/research/consumer-search-behavior-decisions/">BRIGHTLOCAL · 2026 ↗</a></article>
  </div>
  <p class="facts-source">Survey results describe consumer behavior, not guaranteed sales gains. The 2026 BrightLocal decision research sampled 1,227 recent U.S. local-business searchers.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="pricing-section" id="pricing">
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-head"><div><p class="section-kicker">THE REAL NUMBERS</p><h2>Pay for the site.<br/><em>Not the hype.</em></h2></div><p>Start small, grow when you need to. Every quote tells you what's included, what's separate, and who owns what.</p></div>
  <div class="pricing-table">
    {offers.map((p,i)=><article class:list={['offer',{'first-offer':i===0}]}>
      <div class="offer-intro"><span class="offer-label">{i===0?'THE EASY START':'WEBSITE BUILD'}</span><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.intro}</p></div>
      <div class="offer-price"><strong>{p.price}</strong><small>one time</small></div>
      <ul>{p.perks.map(item=><li><span>✓</span>{item}</li>)}</ul>
      <div class="offer-foot"><p>{p.detail}</p><a href={mail(p.slug)} aria-label={'Ask about '+p.name}>↗</a></div>
    </article>)}
  </div>
  <div class="extra-note"><span>NEED MORE SPACE?</span><p><b>Additional pages from $99 each.</b> Extensive copywriting, bookings, e-commerce, integrations, databases and extra revisions are quoted before work begins.</p></div>
  <p class="pricing-disclosure"><b>No hidden fees:</b> Your domain registration and renewals, hosting, email licenses, third-party services and unusual usage charges are separate and disclosed. Customers ordinarily pay those providers directly. Domain ownership and agreed completed deliverables remain yours.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="care-section section" id="care">
  <div class="section-head"><div><p class="section-kicker">OPTIONAL CARE</p><h2>Stay online.<br/><em>Stay in control.</em></h2></div><p>Hosting and upkeep are not mandatory. Keep your own hosting or choose a simple, month-to-month care plan.</p></div>
  <div class="care-row">{care.map(p=><article><div><h3>{p.name}</h3><strong>{p.price}<span>/mo</span></strong></div><p>{p.detail}</p></article>)}</div>
  <div class="care-note"><b>Clear from the start.</b> Standard plans assume eligible static sites and ordinary usage. Domains, email licenses, special integrations and unusual provider charges are separate. Care is optional and cancellable with 30 days' notice; unused edit minutes don't roll over.</div>
</section>
<section class="contact-section" id="contact">
  <div class="section contact-inner"><div><span class="section-kicker">GOT A PROJECT?</span><h2>Good ideas<br/>start <em>here.</em></h2><p>Tell us about the business you're building. We'll put together a sensible scope and explain the costs before anything begins.</p><div class="contact-location">✳ Chilton, Wisconsin · Chilton App Works LLC</div></div><div class="contact-cta"><span>LET'S GET SOMETHING STARTED</span><h3>Even a simple site<br/>can make a big impact.</h3><a href={mail('Website or custom software inquiry')}>Send a project email <b>↗</b></a><small>Opens your email app. No information is collected on this preview page.</small></div></div>
</section>
</main>
<footer><div class="footer-inner"><a href="#top"><img src={logo} width="240" height="95" alt="Chilton App Works" /></a><p>Websites. Custom software. Straightforward costs.</p><span>© 2026 Chilton App Works LLC · Unlisted design preview</span><a href="/chilton-app-works-preview">Original preview ↗</a></div></footer>
</body></html>
